<title>BELGIUM: Belgian unemployment falls to 13.5 pct in November.</title>
<headline>Belgian unemployment falls to 13.5 pct in November.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian National Employment Office released the following unemployment data -</p>
<p>    BELGIAN UNEMPLOYMENT	   NOV 96     OCT 96     NOV 1995</p>
<p>    Total registered jobless (*) 578,665    589,960    609,670</p>
<p>    Pct of workforce		  13.5	 13.8	 14.4</p>
<p>NOTE - (*) all registered unemployed, whether or not they receive unemployment benefits.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
